# Optional. Enables the low-confidence classifier fallback in the add-expense flow.
#
# The app is fully functional without this: the deterministic parser handles the
# entry path on its own, and /api/classify returns 501 when the key is absent,
# which the client treats as "no suggestion" and shows nothing.
#
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and put it in .env.local
# (which is gitignored). Never commit a real key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
